ooksT:"Looks", pfLooksD:"avatar, the «{f}» frame, card background, board and checkers", rkInfoT:"Ranks", rkInfoD:"Your rank depends on your rating. Every rank has six dice — collect all six to move up. The frame of any rank you have reached can be chosen in the Collection.", rkFromStart:"from the first game", rkFrom:"from rating {n}", rkHowT:"How the rating works", rkHow1:"The first 10 games with opponents are calibration, like in Dota or CS. A hidden rating moves fast and depends on whom you beat; the better you play, the stronger your opponents. After game 10 you get your rank, up to 2000. Practice bot games do not count.", rkHow2:"An equal opponent: ±30. Beating a much stronger one: up to +60, a weaker one: a few points; losing to a weaker one: up to −60.", rkHow3:"A mars (the opponent bore off no checkers) counts double — for the win and for the loss.", rkHow4:"The rating counts only in online games.", setAccT:"Account", cardD:"The background of the player card in your profile. Hover or tap a background to see how the card will look.", saved:"Saved", calBotTip:"Practice bot games do not count for calibration — use «Find an opponent» for it.", calibStats:"Wins: {w} of {n} · mars: {m}", calibBest:"strongest beaten: {r}", cardOn:"yours now", cardFree:"free", cardOpen:"unlocked", cardSet:"The «{n}» background is yours", searchBotNote:"If we find nobody in 30 seconds you play a bot (that game does not count for calibration).", searchBotGo:"Nobody found — playing a bot", avg_special:"Special", avg_specialD:"Rewards: Vlad and Pasha — for the first lesson of the «Hookah bar evenings» course. Avatars for tournaments and events will appear here later.", avg_male:"Men", avg_female:"Women", avg_none:"No avatar", avg_locked:"Unlocks after the first lesson with Vlad and Pasha", tourSimPrep:"Connecting to the broadcast…", tourSimEnd:"Match over — {n} won", banLivePts:"Tournament points · +{n} this tournament (place bonus after the final)", tourSwR:"Swiss · round {r}", tourSwAd